sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant sender as netserv send
  participant receiver as netserv get
  participant disk as Output directory

  sender->>sender: Build multipart body, measure length
  sender->>+receiver: GET /token/{size}
  receiver-->>-sender: Signed token, valid 30s

  sender->>+receiver: POST /upload with Authorization

  alt Gate passes
    receiver->>receiver: Parse stream with busboy
    receiver->>disk: Pipe each part to a write stream
    receiver-->>-sender: 200, empty body
  else Not multipart or size mismatch
    receiver-->>sender: 400
  else Missing token
    receiver-->>sender: 401
  else IP mismatch
    receiver-->>sender: 403
  end

  Note over sender,receiver: Both sides render a progress bar
